<title>USA: Birmingham Airport, Ala., yields 5.80 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Birmingham Airport, Ala., yields 5.80 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities Inc said Tuesday it tentatively priced $29.1 million Birmingham Airport Authority, Ala., revenue bonds at a top yield of 5.80 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>BIRMINGHAM AIRPORT AUTHORITY (ALABAMA)</p>
<p>RE: $29,115,000*</p>
<p>AIRPORT REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>(NON-AMT)</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: NAF		   S&amp;P: AAA		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 10/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
